		{
			dependencies: ["504F53000000100A"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0101: Posting]"
				""
				"There used to be a town here. There's still a sign, if you squint."
				"NCP left a few machines behind when it pulled out, and nobody ever came back for them."
				"Get them running, then get them running &owithout&r you, and NCP will hand you &bClearance Level 1&r."
				"&7Steam works, if you're the sentimental kind. You won't need it: everything here runs on ULV power."
				"&7Enclosed: two sugar cane. Plant them by the spring. GregTech eats paper like a goat."
			]
			id: "398DA3318FB70483"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "623745498615BEEC"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
