		}
		{
			dependencies: ["398DA3318FB70483"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0102: Strata]"
				""
				"Hit cobblestone hard enough and it turns to gravel. Hit it enough times and, once in a while,"
				"the void coughs something up: a &bstratum&r. A layer of the old world, pressed thin."
				"Smelt one for a few nuggets (nine to an ingot). Crush it later for a whole dust."
				"&7A mortar pulls atoms out of it too: see Breaking Metal."
				"&7The stone hammer only finds iron and copper. An iron-grade hammer finds tin, coal and lead in gravel;"
				"&7a steel one finds redstone and nickel in sand. After that it's machines, and your arms can rest."
			]
			id: "646ADF5E2F61D70F"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "5468AE95DAD235D4"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
