		{
			dependencies: ["0E9A732B4BBA6767"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0104: Tooling]"
				""
				"GregTech doesn't let you cheat. Plates want a hammer. Casings want a wrench."
				"Cables want a wire cutter, and the wire cutter wants a &bscrewdriver&r inside it. So does the blast furnace."
				"Make the set. Then look at that hammer again:"
				"&abreak gravel with it&r and it finds what the stone one couldn't. &bStannic&r for tin, &bCarbonic&r for coal, &bPlumbic&r for lead."
			]
			id: "076E7CC3AFDAC867"
			rewards: [
