			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0105: Gravel]"
				""
				"Under the gravel there's another layer, and you'll need every bit of it."
				"Tin for solder and bronze. Coal for steel. Lead for cable."
				"&7The stone hammer won't find any of it. It just makes sand, and God knows you have enough sand."
			]
