		{
			dependencies: ["33CDAA74B84BB5D0"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0106: Blast Furnace]"
				""
				"Every circuit needs redstone, and redstone sits deeper than iron can dig."
				"So you need &bsteel&r, and you need it without a single machine. The &bPrimitive Blast Furnace&r will do it:"
				"iron, coal and time."
				"&aFirebricks are a chore:&r mortar clay into clay dust and bricks into brick dust; mix them into fireclay dust;"
				"press it into compressed fireclay by hand; fire it in a furnace. Four firebrick make a firebricks block."
				"&7EMI shows the shape. It's slow and hot and it smells like a blacksmith's apron. It's worth it."
			]
			id: "254E5FE186B806B8"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "0452852DED743AE9"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
