			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0108: Hull]"
				""
				"Every machine you'll ever own starts as one of these: an empty box, waiting to be told what it is."
				"Build your first. You'll build hundreds."
				"&7Wood planks: a GregTech hammer and two wood pulp. Cables: a wire and a rubber plate (see Rubber)."
