		{
			dependencies: ["10BB65E601DDE91E" "3F19BE1DC07334EB"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0113: Ore Generator]"
				""
				"The Mk I gives you cobblestone. The Mk II gives you the old world, one stratum at a time,"
				"steady as a heartbeat: &bSeed I strata&r, straight out of the void."
				"It costs stone bricks, iron blocks, steel and a &bfull Klein Star Ein&r. Your Mk I isn't part of the deal:"
				"it stays where it is and keeps working."
				"&aFill the star&r in your Beam Capacitor: Reclaimer atoms in, 50,000 EMC out."
				"Then build another Ore Generator, and more machines to eat what they make. That's the whole job, really."
			]
			id: "473628F3957FFFB0"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "75BD420F9C0DED68"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
