					item: "usrg:oregenerator"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Reclamation Mk II"
			x: 18.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["076E7CC3AFDAC867"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0114: Rubber]"
				""
				"No rubber trees, no resin. No resin, no rubber trees. You see the problem."
				"Positronic Memory sees the way out: rubber is isoprene, C5H8, and you can build it atom by atom on the crafting table."
				"&b1 carbon + 4 hydrogen = 1 methane&r (CH4). &b2 methane + 3 carbon = 2 sticky resin&r."
				"&aRubber plate by hand:&r mortar + 2 sticky resin = raw rubber dust; smelt it into a plate."
				"Wire + plate = cable, and the hull needs two."
				"&aThe saplings&r grow real rubber trees. Break the tree's own logs and they bleed resin most of the time."
				"&7Logs you placed yourself, or logs from a botany pot, won't. The tree knows. Don't ask me how."
			]
			id: "45ED338A938645F1"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "793BD3CFED095A55"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 2
					id: "07C1E0B6CDA87CC9"
					item: "gtceu:rubber_sapling"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			tasks: [
				{
					count: 2L
					id: "0BDF61E6DE8BB7B6"
					item: "gtceu:rubber_plate"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Rubber"
			x: 10.5d
			y: 2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["271F6CBDB4715876"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0115: Memory]"
				""
				"There it is: your first ingot. Hold it a second."
				"Then meet the &bTransmutation Tablet&r: four iron, four glass, and your NCP Scrip to log you in."
				"It reads and writes &bPositronic Memory&r (EMC), and Memory is picky. It only understands &bchemistry&r:"
				"elements and molecules. An iron ingot means nothing to it. Sixteen &biron atoms&r (ChemLib) mean everything."
				"Burn an element into the tablet and it remembers. After that, spend EMC and it makes more."
				"At LV the &bDissolver&r turns your production into elements, and a GregTech compressor packs 16 of them"
				"back into one dust, one tier after you first need that metal. The planets you'll still do by hand."
				"&7Enclosed: 20 carbon and 20 hydrogen atoms. Burn one of each to teach it. The rest is your first rubber."
			]
			id: "69ADFFCDC361D941"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "72B102FFF455806A"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 20
					id: "50A3B7F64BC625A0"
					item: "chemlib:carbon"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 20
					id: "08C5A3FDDFE4E313"
					item: "chemlib:hydrogen"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			tasks: [
				{
