				}
			]
			title: "Positronic Memory"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["69ADFFCDC361D941"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0116: Biomass]"
				""
				"Every plant is chemistry, and Memory reads chemistry. A plant is &bcellulose&r: C6H10O5, twenty-one atoms."
				"&aMortar + 8 leaves&r (or 4 saplings, 8 crops, 8 sugar cane) = 1 &bplant mass&r."
				"&aMortar + 2 plant mass&r = 1 &bcellulose&r, worth exactly its 6 carbon, 10 hydrogen and 5 oxygen."
				"&aMortar + 1 rock dust&r (sand broken with any hammer) = 1 &bsilicon dioxide&r."
				"Stone pays less than green things. It usually does."
				"Burn one cellulose to teach it, and everything you grow after that is money."
				"Need the atoms themselves (rubber wants carbon and hydrogen)? Buy them back in the tablet."
				"&7Enclosed: sugar cane. It grows in a botany pot, and it's the fastest biomass you've got."
				"&7Leaves need shears (two iron). Once you have proper tools, the NCP Shop sells a reinforced pair."
			]
			id: "556BA39D6B479B11"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "1AA4009389D0AE56"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
