		{
			dependencies: ["556BA39D6B479B11" "5BF37B5D49C970E6"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0118: Automation]"
				""
				"Grinding by hand pays, but it pays you in your own hours, and you only get so many."
				"The &bAtomic Reclaimer&r (ULV) does the same work on power."
				"&aThe simplest line there is:&r a &bhopper botany pot&r of cane on top of a hopper, feeding the Reclaimer;"
				"another hopper under the Reclaimer, into a chest. No pipes. No wrench. No thinking."
				"&7Craft the hopper pot, or buy one at the NCP Shop (8 Scrip). Keep 128 of the hydrogen it makes for this memo."
				"A pot of cane grows &b8 a minute&r (about 5,000 EMC an hour). One Reclaimer keeps up with 12 pots."
				"&aWhat it eats:&r biomass (16 leaves, 8 saplings, 16 crops or cane, 2 plant mass, 8 wood pulp) = 6 C, 10 H, 5 O."
				"Rock dust = 1 Si + 2 O (and a trace of aluminium). Honey and wax pay well."
				"Seed I strata = 5 atoms of their metal, like the mortar. Fed by an Ore Generator, that's your best EMC."
				"Rubric strata give only their 5 silicon atoms here. Want the redstone? Crush those instead."
				"It also splits your hand-made cellulose and silicon dioxide back into atoms."
				"&aTo bank it:&r pipe the atoms into a &bBasic EMC Link&r (ProjectExpansion), and the EMC lands on your tablet."
				"&7At LV, electrolysis (water) and the centrifuge (air) bring hydrogen, oxygen, nitrogen and argon, paid in EU."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:ulv_atomic_reclaimer"
			id: "0788A02A25C2D582"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "384E4812D9FF15B8"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			tasks: [
				{
					icon: "gtceu:ulv_atomic_reclaimer"
					id: "739849B36F6BEC2A"
					observe_type: 0
					timer: 0L
					to_observe: "gtceu:ulv_atomic_reclaimer"
					type: "observation"
				}
				{
					icon: "botanypots:terracotta_hopper_botany_pot"
