					item: "projecte:klein_star_ein"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "The Beam Capacitor"
			x: 16.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["473628F3957FFFB0"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0120: Charging]"
				""
				"A Klein Star Zwei holds &b200,000 EMC&r (four Ein stars, combined). Core I wants one full to the brim."
				"Not almost full. Full."
				"&aThe engine:&r an Ore Generator makes 30 Seed I strata a minute, and an Atomic Reclaimer breaks each one"
				"into 5 atoms (40 EMC). Ore Generator -> 2 Reclaimers -> Capacitor is about 58,000 EMC an hour, with nobody watching."
				"&7Pull some Rubric strata out before the Reclaimers and crush them: circuits still want redstone."
				"&7Plants alone are slower: a pot of cane is about 5,000 EMC an hour."
			]
			id: "73A4CD65D47CBF1A"
			rewards: [
