			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0121: Keystone]"
				""
				"A full star in the middle and the best of this tier around it, on a plain &bcrafting table&r:"
				"4 bronze blocks, 2 ULV hulls, 2 vacuum tubes."
				"It looks like a toy. It isn't. Hold it near your ear and it hums, like something in there is thinking."
				"Maybe something is."
				"The Core is never used up: it's the catalyst for your first Clearance Card."
				"&7Every Core after this wants a bigger grid: 4x4 at LV, 5x5 at MV, 7x7 at EV, 9x9 at LuV."
			]
