			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0123: First Multiblock]"
				""
				"Your first multiblock: a 3x3x3 box of solid steel casings, hollow in the middle,"
				"with the controller at the bottom centre of the front face."
				"Swap casings for an input bus, an output bus, a maintenance hatch and an energy hatch."
				"It sifts the same as the single machine, until you give it an LV energy hatch: then it overclocks, twice the speed."
				"&7The GT terminal shows you the shape before you build it wrong."
			]
